{
  "id": "628ea7936db60e2d5b0b1dd3",
  "title": "快打旋风3",
  "summary": "这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。 作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、艾迪科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。 这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。 本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。 搓招意义不太…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fa1e977f5ef67456f67987f83c05fba7c349d56b051e6ab3cfa7890debc00b9e258bcea460c1eb8e67965360429ee2cd2f623dbdf776f42b2fec3ff9b8e7fd4f00\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a></p>\n<p>这次选个直截了当的游戏清清脑子。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8957c2711e2680ea41ded82c260c3ae99887a7596e76c07550bb7af9a2844167bbd6b6e5d666381c77f27be1830c698941214114ae36b3bf3b93ec7522a0607569ed608a274064e9d1b183b54effd5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_043\"></a></p>\n<p>作为卡婊清版动作类的开山鼻祖，《快打旋风》<sup><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/babb8208b1d8483aac7474d2f19e274d4be819a7c71ea75ef694768127d41b2c18f7ac8dac087d19792e7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">[2]</a></sup> 除了初代在各个平台疯狂炒冷饭以外，更多的是利用了角色的剩余价值。哈格、<del>艾迪</del>科迪、凯，乃至敌方角色苏杜姆、罗兰多、艾迪、毒药、安德鲁都在另外的卡普空宇宙中疯狂出场，但自身的正宗续作《快打旋风2》《快打旋风3》的自身水准和外部评价都不太高。3代比2代强一点。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ff3849fa4193223e3578f0373fdbebaf01b45cadfb5ec0e972fad6f1122792f939cf1bbd99e797d65a9aedc3a12d7f0f6048a120485a6387a81565f991c1931d15771555613964618d7c6c1f205430\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次玩的3代，在系统上对比1代其实改进非常多：加入了搓招、跑动攻击、超必杀，流畅性对比难度贼高的1代提升很大。但要说多好玩呢，也并没有。3代是超任独占的，家用机的性能决定了同屏敌人最多4个，再难能难哪去？倒是我选的露西亚贫攻，常常出现因时间不够而引起的恐慌。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dedb476a63e989aebd6ffc449fc4ded247ae1025f487b0102e54b1d11eda68dbc4a9b07816b8213f63b64762744dfe322349d3f6584cbc5ff62251c1d82a8df5977fa46f84ef4df3a2842863da1b7e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_014\"></a></p>\n<p>本来我玩游戏都是首选日版，其次美版。但这个游戏强烈推荐欧版。按住SELECT进入标题画面，后面就谁用谁知道了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9acd5eb04af0bedd2dfda96881c39999800361d9487e2be0a3bb643031cd853483fb767aa9e9fa2f05624f35e8a89f0a0865f4ccb7fcb99b1320ad4a6ce998f1d29020a1c94a5b310761a7371a94f0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_008\"></a></p>\n<p>搓招意义不太大，起码对于女主露西亚是这样。升龙腿收招破绽极大，除了耍帅，就只有落地挨揍的用处。而那个SUPER气槽存在的时间又短，BOSS战时难以抓住时机，也是只能装B用。最实用的还是跑动攻击，手速够的话能把敌人连到死，也挺爽。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/45f357fd8f6b73e48d0bfe23af8bdfa871b604053480fa80e2e87491bf12b664d992ba6f9b3359d3ebd4d8e8f464ee855e9d7977a539915cbcd338b9d312998c696ee6bd8ee20f2f1c714309a8b4e9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_003\"></a></p>\n<p>清版动作最重要的还是那说不清道不明的打击感。本作这方面还行，但从出品时间来看，比对面的格斗四人组系列还是稍逊一筹。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0c00ec1847cf761ecd3483384e90649e90aa931ae1e6ba2a39d4440f7c2f52db9ed5a729f8481067c0e1f1f63fb9aa74c38a2ad3bddc6a07b2bf236b64426b985e6b7405d74246bb43ff728b3959a0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_028\"></a></p>\n<p>分支路线算特色吗？在1995年这个时间点看来不算，只能算“借鉴”来的。但某些路线可以跳过BOSS，也是挺值得的。有一条不太容易出现的路线是唐人街，场景设计还是挺赞的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8fef15bef9f60b7b8b4e695558ea33be0c8a14a283b860f678aa6e448f90ba2e967fff53f8f98dc212535cba56e8621b70793d0dc366040ddd15d1169dcf2eb158289509bfc2d3f0498271bc340347\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_030\"></a></p>\n<p>只是这一关的BOSS嘛，有点刻板印象了。这只BOSS会点穴嘿！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1ebaa4ed7a4cc9751d53b65d85f8bd3c99a85ccd7cffe2e6105967498ebf3519326186f79ce77e655d94b52f3af59be961a7fbf3fcaef726194af4ff6b6d612f6538e91a7adf3001e9a2eea9ef068e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_063\"></a></p>\n<p>其余的BOSS们。只打一遍可是会认不全的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b42982027cb6b3d1ee02f12df7a0059f94e2d334a523f3bd82863b6874e438ed6566e8da2a9c4b894ec97e6914ba337ca079f8faca91be19402d1f64aff932aaf7e2dcc3de282b0f78c692f279a145\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_006\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c04cfbda01aaedf29ba62a2d4112c59cf42c76ac56f6139d8fde2d03eaf1439c401593fda4fefb2773d344ac294e83e6396ced3cbdf47f5746d95b89859426ba0e6e92377a67eaa7dd2979e727a579\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/711220c61601e663bc509a8a6dbd3076cf5b5246cde0ce6e0baa052a11dc4b1962238eb692608c69f720f9c2bbcc9fe64d896c5b116abdc825ecfdbb4f3917146b4ea6a07fc65e6eb0f5ae5049ff89\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_048\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/932e44a9d5aef4adb8d8cebc3752ef959e72f3ff3838bfe1f077b5eeddbf1b6b802365014923494cc44d48879344e05cb7a5ad2248c4ec882d95606ca7e3af690aa0ba7e30925c4586018727674b17\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/493e8f839898cc9980510d1a0291eb1e6d0cf361f9e6564fed99b87b859f42ff99c6540c886cf47dd8cb814f8b11b101e75175bad17156df9ae22e9c5c847388994973c800a0588bd0a076db45fd6f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_019\"></a></p>\n<p>最终BOSS，只要不被抓住，不难。最后死在电网上，哪怕不是在电网这侧打死的，也会强行漂移过去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/855917164706275d05a7e94f68981a5197e5a5f3e2398d0a6fc88501180dd3de3358ea32e4084ee7befcd8c9e9419cf2d19a0cf81a29b59be0d0a2dbc1d8f9e1b5b99069ff4ba7da16543d9463b44d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/962771a47114b5277978604acb675d31a0364739adefb23f0d130261c1e89b236f1c3eab02d30682a219acefa93909a6f4c37bf81a13374ca030581f466144ee5024496e871f6e29cc74b03601c80c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_025\"></a></p>\n<p>通关画面，明显男主角金毛的迪恩跟另外三个尿不到一个坑里。迪恩在卡普空后续的其它游戏里再没出现过。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8ab301034c42d5904aa6fec88746d21e321b55b34554d76b671ab1740b5e1db828335f4b8704ec0e41860e3960d443ca0f9d06bcfb40ddbc2f627cdc32f5677776efbebb87ed0844c0e0a0e7a73e5e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_031\"></a></p>\n<p>选最高难度才能出现真正的结局，也就是“END”这三个字。不值！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c26f2010399e5586cca984176b032f87b231028e2a01e5851776fb5b91946ec4f791a18151d6227ca99928e5a04ce79ea27d8675beead0db77dc892d2a98b2a002954d584f070901c5c55e194100bd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3f8a3536802cbab7d79b41f45c0b642575d69cc38dd1e727bb3f24ab5e91dab77ee7fe641f6106c4e2b57b13b9393e23835ce1c785be347cb5585c3f9454684b7deea6a6ff124de6bb54dee23555b5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Final_Fight_3_032\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(2)</a>：Street Fighter = 陆港街头霸王=台快打旋风，Final Fight = 陆港快打旋风 = 台街头快打</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/final-fight-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">快打旋风3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/11/darkwing-duck.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">狡猾飞天德</a><span>[53%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2022/08/ninja-ryuuken-den-tomoe.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者龙剑传：巴</a><span>[51%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/03/tenchi-o-kurau-ii-shokatsu-koumei-den.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吞食天地2：诸葛孔明传</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[40%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2019/05/e-v-o-search-of-enden.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">46亿年物语</a><span>[38%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
